[36m(TaskRunner pid=75873)[0m - \(b = 1, e = 1\): \(3 \times 2 = 6 \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=75873)[0m - \(b = 4, e = 0\): \(1 \times 1 = 1 \equiv 1 \pmod{5}\)
[36m(TaskRunner pid=75873)[0m 
